OnlyPauserTest
├── given caller is not set as pauser for pauseType
│   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
│   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│       └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── given caller is set as pauser for pauseType
│   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   └── it should allow function execution
│   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│       └── it should allow function execution
└── given caller is pauser for different pauseType
    └── it should revert with Unauthorized 